{"title":"🐾 Give Back: TNR Cat Rescue Volunteer Day","startsAt":"2026-10-15T17:30:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-15T22:00:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"Please read the details before RSVPing.\n\n🐾 Time to give back, guys\n\nWe’ve partnered with a non-profit animal rescue group to support a TNR (Trap-Neuter-Return) campaign in Scarborough, near 75 Birchmount Ave.\n\nWe’re looking for volunteers to help with\n\n1. 🪤 Setting up traps at designated locations\n2. 🚗 Transporting cats to/from the clinic\n3. 🐱 Feeding cats at designated locations\n\nSome activities require access to your own vehicle, while others simply require your time and willingness to help.\n\nEvery little bit helps, and the cats definitely need us. ❤️?\n\nAnyone allergic to cats, furs or anything related to animals, please do not signup\n\nYou participate this in this event at your own risk. Organizers of this meetup or anyone who is part of this campaign isn't responsible for any untoward incident during your participation in this event .","venue":{"name":"Scarborough Gardens Arena","address":"75 Birchmount Road, Scarborough","lat":43.6948,"lng":-79.26197,"city":"Scarborough"},"fee":null,"group":"Vibe & Wander","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/1/4/5/e/highres_536345214.jpeg"}